{
 "fps": 30,
 "durationInFrames": 21017,
 "seconds": 700.57,
 "cues": [
  {
   "i": 0,
   "start": 0.6,
   "end": 5.079,
   "startFrame": 18,
   "endFrame": 152,
   "words": 19,
   "text": "On the morning of day two, I had a little over one bottle of water and nothing to eat."
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "start": 5.629,
   "end": 9.344,
   "startFrame": 169,
   "endFrame": 280,
   "words": 14,
   "text": "The message that came in at dawn said to reach River Crossing before noon."
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "start": 9.894,
   "end": 11.784,
   "startFrame": 297,
   "endFrame": 354,
   "words": 7,
   "text": "I didn't know how far that was."
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "start": 12.134,
   "end": 15.401,
   "startFrame": 364,
   "endFrame": 462,
   "words": 10,
   "text": "I didn't know if the evacuation point was still operating."
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "start": 15.751,
   "end": 19.644,
   "startFrame": 473,
   "endFrame": 589,
   "words": 13,
   "text": "But this room had no water supply, and I couldn't stay here forever."
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "start": 20.194,
   "end": 21.561,
   "startFrame": 606,
   "endFrame": 647,
   "words": 4,
   "text": "I decided to go."
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "start": 22.111,
   "end": 24.499,
   "startFrame": 663,
   "endFrame": 735,
   "words": 8,
   "text": "I slid the bolt back across the door."
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "start": 24.849,
   "end": 27.798,
   "startFrame": 745,
   "endFrame": 834,
   "words": 11,
   "text": "If I was going out, I wanted to do it properly."
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "start": 28.348,
   "end": 30.276,
   "startFrame": 850,
   "endFrame": 908,
   "words": 7,
   "text": "I opened the notes on my phone."
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "start": 30.826,
   "end": 32.87,
   "startFrame": 925,
   "endFrame": 986,
   "words": 5,
   "text": "Rule one: Noise attracts them."
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "start": 33.42,
   "end": 36.419,
   "startFrame": 1003,
   "endFrame": 1093,
   "words": 11,
   "text": "The water bottle I'd dropped last night had taught me that."
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "start": 36.969,
   "end": 40.951,
   "startFrame": 1109,
   "endFrame": 1229,
   "words": 9,
   "text": "I turned off notification sounds, keyboard sounds, and vibration."
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "start": 41.301,
   "end": 43.523,
   "startFrame": 1239,
   "endFrame": 1306,
   "words": 8,
   "text": "Then I checked for any alarms I'd set."
  },
  {
   "i": 13,
   "start": 44.073,
   "end": 46.512,
   "startFrame": 1322,
   "endFrame": 1395,
   "words": 9,
   "text": "I didn't want to make the same mistake again."
  },
  {
   "i": 14,
   "start": 47.062,
   "end": 48.531,
   "startFrame": 1412,
   "endFrame": 1456,
   "words": 4,
   "text": "Next was my hand."
  },
  {
   "i": 15,
   "start": 49.081,
   "end": 51.8,
   "startFrame": 1472,
   "endFrame": 1554,
   "words": 9,
   "text": "The cloth I'd wrapped around it yesterday was dirty."
  },
  {
   "i": 16,
   "start": 52.15,
   "end": 54.117,
   "startFrame": 1564,
   "endFrame": 1624,
   "words": 7,
   "text": "One edge had stuck to the scrape."
  },
  {
   "i": 17,
   "start": 54.467,
   "end": 57.186,
   "startFrame": 1634,
   "endFrame": 1716,
   "words": 9,
   "text": "I peeled it away slowly, but it still hurt."
  },
  {
   "i": 18,
   "start": 57.736,
   "end": 60.366,
   "startFrame": 1732,
   "endFrame": 1811,
   "words": 9,
   "text": "I replaced it with a cleaner strip of cloth."
  },
  {
   "i": 19,
   "start": 60.716,
   "end": 62.581,
   "startFrame": 1821,
   "endFrame": 1877,
   "words": 6,
   "text": "I could still move my fingers."
  },
  {
   "i": 20,
   "start": 62.931,
   "end": 64.821,
   "startFrame": 1888,
   "endFrame": 1945,
   "words": 5,
   "text": "Closing my hand was harder."
  },
  {
   "i": 21,
   "start": 65.371,
   "end": 67.389,
   "startFrame": 1961,
   "endFrame": 2022,
   "words": 6,
   "text": "I packed the water and flashlight."
  },
  {
   "i": 22,
   "start": 67.739,
   "end": 71.708,
   "startFrame": 2032,
   "endFrame": 2151,
   "words": 15,
   "text": "Then I checked the zippers and made sure nothing was hanging loose outside the bag."
  },
  {
   "i": 23,
   "start": 72.258,
   "end": 77.107,
   "startFrame": 2168,
   "endFrame": 2313,
   "words": 22,
   "text": "Before leaving, I took a good look at the door and the buildings around it so I could find my way back."
  },
  {
   "i": 24,
   "start": 77.657,
   "end": 81.703,
   "startFrame": 2330,
   "endFrame": 2451,
   "words": 14,
   "text": "If I couldn't reach the evacuation point, at least I still had this place."
  },
  {
   "i": 25,
   "start": 82.253,
   "end": 84.654,
   "startFrame": 2468,
   "endFrame": 2540,
   "words": 7,
   "text": "There were abandoned cars along the street."
  },
  {
   "i": 26,
   "start": 85.003,
   "end": 86.906,
   "startFrame": 2550,
   "endFrame": 2607,
   "words": 6,
   "text": "Some still had their doors open."
  },
  {
   "i": 27,
   "start": 87.256,
   "end": 89.83500000000001,
   "startFrame": 2618,
   "endFrame": 2695,
   "words": 6,
   "text": "Belongings lay scattered across the pavement."
  },
  {
   "i": 28,
   "start": 90.385,
   "end": 94.801,
   "startFrame": 2712,
   "endFrame": 2844,
   "words": 15,
   "text": "I stayed near the buildings and avoided gaps between cars where I couldn't see ahead."
  },
  {
   "i": 29,
   "start": 95.351,
   "end": 98.682,
   "startFrame": 2861,
   "endFrame": 2960,
   "words": 11,
   "text": "At each corner, I stopped to listen before looking around it."
  },
  {
   "i": 30,
   "start": 99.232,
   "end": 102.449,
   "startFrame": 2977,
   "endFrame": 3073,
   "words": 9,
   "text": "Once, I heard dragging footsteps just beyond a turn."
  },
  {
   "i": 31,
   "start": 102.799,
   "end": 105.30199999999999,
   "startFrame": 3084,
   "endFrame": 3159,
   "words": 8,
   "text": "I waited behind the wall until they passed."
  },
  {
   "i": 32,
   "start": 105.852,
   "end": 109.91,
   "startFrame": 3176,
   "endFrame": 3297,
   "words": 18,
   "text": "It was slow, but I didn't want to turn a corner and walk straight into one of them."
  },
  {
   "i": 33,
   "start": 110.46000000000001,
   "end": 113.792,
   "startFrame": 3314,
   "endFrame": 3414,
   "words": 9,
   "text": "A sign said River Crossing was eleven kilometers away."
  },
  {
   "i": 34,
   "start": 114.342,
   "end": 115.67099999999999,
   "startFrame": 3430,
   "endFrame": 3470,
   "words": 4,
   "text": "I checked the time."
  },
  {
   "i": 35,
   "start": 116.021,
   "end": 117.477,
   "startFrame": 3481,
   "endFrame": 3524,
   "words": 4,
   "text": "It wasn't six yet."
  },
  {
   "i": 36,
   "start": 118.027,
   "end": 121.971,
   "startFrame": 3541,
   "endFrame": 3659,
   "words": 13,
   "text": "With all these stops, I'd be lucky to manage three kilometers an hour."
  },
  {
   "i": 37,
   "start": 122.321,
   "end": 124.326,
   "startFrame": 3670,
   "endFrame": 3730,
   "words": 6,
   "text": "That meant four or five hours."
  },
  {
   "i": 38,
   "start": 124.676,
   "end": 127.535,
   "startFrame": 3740,
   "endFrame": 3826,
   "words": 11,
   "text": "If the roads were clear, I could get there before noon."
  },
  {
   "i": 39,
   "start": 127.885,
   "end": 131.714,
   "startFrame": 3837,
   "endFrame": 3951,
   "words": 15,
   "text": "But I also needed food, and I would have to avoid them along the way."
  },
  {
   "i": 40,
   "start": 132.264,
   "end": 134.435,
   "startFrame": 3968,
   "endFrame": 4033,
   "words": 8,
   "text": "I put the phone away and kept walking."
  },
  {
   "i": 41,
   "start": 134.985,
   "end": 138.827,
   "startFrame": 4050,
   "endFrame": 4165,
   "words": 12,
   "text": "On a side street, I spotted one standing beside a parked car."
  },
  {
   "i": 42,
   "start": 139.377,
   "end": 141.713,
   "startFrame": 4181,
   "endFrame": 4251,
   "words": 6,
   "text": "I crouched behind a delivery truck."
  },
  {
   "i": 43,
   "start": 142.063,
   "end": 145.203,
   "startFrame": 4262,
   "endFrame": 4356,
   "words": 11,
   "text": "From there, I could watch without stepping out into the open."
  },
  {
   "i": 44,
   "start": 145.753,
   "end": 150.233,
   "startFrame": 4373,
   "endFrame": 4507,
   "words": 13,
   "text": "It moved slowly between two cars, bumped into a door, then changed direction."
  },
  {
   "i": 45,
   "start": 150.78300000000002,
   "end": 152.839,
   "startFrame": 4523,
   "endFrame": 4585,
   "words": 7,
   "text": "A bird flew off a nearby roof."
  },
  {
   "i": 46,
   "start": 153.389,
   "end": 157.192,
   "startFrame": 4602,
   "endFrame": 4716,
   "words": 14,
   "text": "It turned toward the sound of the wings, took a few steps, and stopped."
  },
  {
   "i": 47,
   "start": 157.742,
   "end": 158.74,
   "startFrame": 4732,
   "endFrame": 4762,
   "words": 2,
   "text": "I waited."
  },
  {
   "i": 48,
   "start": 159.29,
   "end": 160.797,
   "startFrame": 4779,
   "endFrame": 4824,
   "words": 5,
   "text": "There was no more noise."
  },
  {
   "i": 49,
   "start": 161.147,
   "end": 163.713,
   "startFrame": 4834,
   "endFrame": 4911,
   "words": 7,
   "text": "After a while, it started wandering again."
  },
  {
   "i": 50,
   "start": 164.263,
   "end": 168.028,
   "startFrame": 4928,
   "endFrame": 5041,
   "words": 15,
   "text": "I still didn't know how well it could see, or whether it could smell me."
  },
  {
   "i": 51,
   "start": 168.578,
   "end": 173.275,
   "startFrame": 5057,
   "endFrame": 5198,
   "words": 18,
   "text": "All I'd seen was that it reacted to a sound, then stopped following when the sound was gone."
  },
  {
   "i": 52,
   "start": 173.825,
   "end": 176.965,
   "startFrame": 5215,
   "endFrame": 5309,
   "words": 10,
   "text": "That wasn't enough to assume silence would keep me safe."
  },
  {
   "i": 53,
   "start": 177.515,
   "end": 180.961,
   "startFrame": 5325,
   "endFrame": 5429,
   "words": 11,
   "text": "I waited until it moved farther away, then crossed the street."
  },
  {
   "i": 54,
   "start": 181.511,
   "end": 185.429,
   "startFrame": 5445,
   "endFrame": 5563,
   "words": 12,
   "text": "Around seven, I found a convenience store with a broken front window."
  },
  {
   "i": 55,
   "start": 185.979,
   "end": 188.048,
   "startFrame": 5579,
   "endFrame": 5641,
   "words": 6,
   "text": "I'd been hungry since waking up."
  },
  {
   "i": 56,
   "start": 188.598,
   "end": 191.993,
   "startFrame": 5658,
   "endFrame": 5760,
   "words": 12,
   "text": "From outside, I could see that most of the shelves were empty."
  },
  {
   "i": 57,
   "start": 192.343,
   "end": 193.953,
   "startFrame": 5770,
   "endFrame": 5819,
   "words": 5,
   "text": "I still wanted to check."
  },
  {
   "i": 58,
   "start": 194.503,
   "end": 199.059,
   "startFrame": 5835,
   "endFrame": 5972,
   "words": 14,
   "text": "I listened for a while, then stepped inside, avoiding the larger pieces of glass."
  },
  {
   "i": 59,
   "start": 199.609,
   "end": 201.78,
   "startFrame": 5988,
   "endFrame": 6053,
   "words": 7,
   "text": "There was a curtain behind the counter."
  },
  {
   "i": 60,
   "start": 202.13,
   "end": 204.785,
   "startFrame": 6064,
   "endFrame": 6144,
   "words": 8,
   "text": "Before searching for food, I pulled it aside."
  },
  {
   "i": 61,
   "start": 205.335,
   "end": 206.588,
   "startFrame": 6160,
   "endFrame": 6198,
   "words": 3,
   "text": "A small storeroom."
  },
  {
   "i": 62,
   "start": 206.938,
   "end": 209.147,
   "startFrame": 6208,
   "endFrame": 6274,
   "words": 7,
   "text": "A fallen shelf blocked the back door."
  },
  {
   "i": 63,
   "start": 209.697,
   "end": 212.65800000000002,
   "startFrame": 6291,
   "endFrame": 6380,
   "words": 14,
   "text": "I wouldn't be able to get out that way if I needed to run."
  },
  {
   "i": 64,
   "start": 213.208,
   "end": 216.425,
   "startFrame": 6396,
   "endFrame": 6493,
   "words": 12,
   "text": "I went back to the front and only searched near the entrance."
  },
  {
   "i": 65,
   "start": 216.975,
   "end": 218.776,
   "startFrame": 6509,
   "endFrame": 6563,
   "words": 6,
   "text": "Most of the food was gone."
  },
  {
   "i": 66,
   "start": 219.126,
   "end": 222.036,
   "startFrame": 6574,
   "endFrame": 6661,
   "words": 8,
   "text": "Empty packets and crushed boxes covered the floor."
  },
  {
   "i": 67,
   "start": 222.586,
   "end": 226.262,
   "startFrame": 6678,
   "endFrame": 6788,
   "words": 13,
   "text": "Behind the counter, I found an unopened packet of mints and a lighter."
  },
  {
   "i": 68,
   "start": 226.812,
   "end": 227.95,
   "startFrame": 6804,
   "endFrame": 6838,
   "words": 3,
   "text": "I took both."
  },
  {
   "i": 69,
   "start": 228.5,
   "end": 233.885,
   "startFrame": 6855,
   "endFrame": 7017,
   "words": 20,
   "text": "I wanted to keep looking, but the longer I stayed, the more chance there was of something reaching the entrance."
  },
  {
   "i": 70,
   "start": 234.435,
   "end": 235.305,
   "startFrame": 7033,
   "endFrame": 7059,
   "words": 2,
   "text": "I left."
  },
  {
   "i": 71,
   "start": 235.855,
   "end": 237.949,
   "startFrame": 7076,
   "endFrame": 7138,
   "words": 7,
   "text": "A little sugar was better than nothing."
  },
  {
   "i": 72,
   "start": 238.299,
   "end": 241.363,
   "startFrame": 7149,
   "endFrame": 7241,
   "words": 13,
   "text": "But a few mints wouldn't be enough for a whole day of walking."
  },
  {
   "i": 73,
   "start": 241.913,
   "end": 245.793,
   "startFrame": 7257,
   "endFrame": 7374,
   "words": 14,
   "text": "I came to a pedestrian overpass and climbed up to see the roads ahead."
  },
  {
   "i": 74,
   "start": 246.343,
   "end": 248.794,
   "startFrame": 7390,
   "endFrame": 7464,
   "words": 9,
   "text": "The road toward the river was full of cars."
  },
  {
   "i": 75,
   "start": 249.344,
   "end": 251.744,
   "startFrame": 7480,
   "endFrame": 7552,
   "words": 8,
   "text": "Some had stopped in the middle of junctions."
  },
  {
   "i": 76,
   "start": 252.094,
   "end": 255.081,
   "startFrame": 7563,
   "endFrame": 7652,
   "words": 10,
   "text": "Others had driven onto the pavement and been left there."
  },
  {
   "i": 77,
   "start": 255.631,
   "end": 257.573,
   "startFrame": 7669,
   "endFrame": 7727,
   "words": 5,
   "text": "Figures were moving between them."
  },
  {
   "i": 78,
   "start": 258.123,
   "end": 261.543,
   "startFrame": 7744,
   "endFrame": 7846,
   "words": 12,
   "text": "I couldn't tell whether they were survivors or more of the infected."
  },
  {
   "i": 79,
   "start": 262.093,
   "end": 263.907,
   "startFrame": 7863,
   "endFrame": 7917,
   "words": 6,
   "text": "I looked for a quieter route."
  },
  {
   "i": 80,
   "start": 264.257,
   "end": 268.009,
   "startFrame": 7928,
   "endFrame": 8040,
   "words": 16,
   "text": "If I followed the main road, there would be little room to get around a group."
  },
  {
   "i": 81,
   "start": 268.559,
   "end": 271.904,
   "startFrame": 8057,
   "endFrame": 8157,
   "words": 10,
   "text": "From the overpass, I spotted a street running alongside it."
  },
  {
   "i": 82,
   "start": 272.254,
   "end": 275.305,
   "startFrame": 8168,
   "endFrame": 8259,
   "words": 11,
   "text": "There were fewer cars, and it led toward the river too."
  },
  {
   "i": 83,
   "start": 275.855,
   "end": 277.796,
   "startFrame": 8276,
   "endFrame": 8334,
   "words": 7,
   "text": "I went down and headed that way."
  },
  {
   "i": 84,
   "start": 278.346,
   "end": 280.631,
   "startFrame": 8350,
   "endFrame": 8419,
   "words": 7,
   "text": "Around nine, I heard a car alarm."
  },
  {
   "i": 85,
   "start": 281.181,
   "end": 284.526,
   "startFrame": 8435,
   "endFrame": 8536,
   "words": 12,
   "text": "I stopped before the corner and looked from behind a parked bus."
  },
  {
   "i": 86,
   "start": 285.076,
   "end": 287.501,
   "startFrame": 8552,
   "endFrame": 8625,
   "words": 8,
   "text": "Dozens of them were gathered around the car."
  },
  {
   "i": 87,
   "start": 288.051,
   "end": 290.197,
   "startFrame": 8642,
   "endFrame": 8706,
   "words": 6,
   "text": "Some were pressed against its doors."
  },
  {
   "i": 88,
   "start": 290.547,
   "end": 292.73,
   "startFrame": 8716,
   "endFrame": 8782,
   "words": 7,
   "text": "Others were still trying to get closer."
  },
  {
   "i": 89,
   "start": 293.28,
   "end": 295.502,
   "startFrame": 8798,
   "endFrame": 8865,
   "words": 8,
   "text": "I needed to reach the road beyond them."
  },
  {
   "i": 90,
   "start": 296.052,
   "end": 298.682,
   "startFrame": 8882,
   "endFrame": 8960,
   "words": 9,
   "text": "Going back to find another route would cost time."
  },
  {
   "i": 91,
   "start": 299.032,
   "end": 301.547,
   "startFrame": 8971,
   "endFrame": 9046,
   "words": 9,
   "text": "Trying to slip past would bring me too close."
  },
  {
   "i": 92,
   "start": 302.097,
   "end": 304.14,
   "startFrame": 9063,
   "endFrame": 9124,
   "words": 7,
   "text": "I backed away to the last junction."
  },
  {
   "i": 93,
   "start": 304.69,
   "end": 307.142,
   "startFrame": 9141,
   "endFrame": 9214,
   "words": 8,
   "text": "The detour wasn't as simple as I'd hoped."
  },
  {
   "i": 94,
   "start": 307.492,
   "end": 309.752,
   "startFrame": 9225,
   "endFrame": 9293,
   "words": 7,
   "text": "One alley ended at a locked fence."
  },
  {
   "i": 95,
   "start": 310.102,
   "end": 312.579,
   "startFrame": 9303,
   "endFrame": 9377,
   "words": 9,
   "text": "I had to turn around and try another street."
  },
  {
   "i": 96,
   "start": 313.129,
   "end": 316.09,
   "startFrame": 9394,
   "endFrame": 9483,
   "words": 10,
   "text": "It took about forty minutes to get past the area."
  },
  {
   "i": 97,
   "start": 316.64,
   "end": 319.066,
   "startFrame": 9499,
   "endFrame": 9572,
   "words": 9,
   "text": "I stopped in the shade and drank some water."
  },
  {
   "i": 98,
   "start": 319.616,
   "end": 321.328,
   "startFrame": 9588,
   "endFrame": 9640,
   "words": 5,
   "text": "The bottle was getting low."
  },
  {
   "i": 99,
   "start": 321.678,
   "end": 327.535,
   "startFrame": 9650,
   "endFrame": 9826,
   "words": 23,
   "text": "I hadn't reached the river yet, and I still needed enough for the walk back if there was nobody at the evacuation point."
  },
  {
   "i": 100,
   "start": 328.085,
   "end": 330.103,
   "startFrame": 9843,
   "endFrame": 9903,
   "words": 7,
   "text": "I tightened the cap and moved on."
  },
  {
   "i": 101,
   "start": 330.653,
   "end": 332.9,
   "startFrame": 9920,
   "endFrame": 9987,
   "words": 7,
   "text": "By about ten, my heel was sore."
  },
  {
   "i": 102,
   "start": 333.45,
   "end": 336.513,
   "startFrame": 10004,
   "endFrame": 10095,
   "words": 10,
   "text": "I stopped in the recessed doorway of a closed pharmacy."
  },
  {
   "i": 103,
   "start": 337.063,
   "end": 340.98199999999997,
   "startFrame": 10112,
   "endFrame": 10229,
   "words": 15,
   "text": "It kept me partly out of sight, but it was still right beside the pavement."
  },
  {
   "i": 104,
   "start": 341.532,
   "end": 345.195,
   "startFrame": 10246,
   "endFrame": 10356,
   "words": 13,
   "text": "I put the bag between my feet, leaned back, and closed my eyes."
  },
  {
   "i": 105,
   "start": 345.745,
   "end": 347.712,
   "startFrame": 10372,
   "endFrame": 10431,
   "words": 8,
   "text": "I only meant to rest for a minute."
  },
  {
   "i": 106,
   "start": 348.262,
   "end": 350.509,
   "startFrame": 10448,
   "endFrame": 10515,
   "words": 6,
   "text": "Dragging footsteps made me open them."
  },
  {
   "i": 107,
   "start": 351.05899999999997,
   "end": 354.148,
   "startFrame": 10532,
   "endFrame": 10624,
   "words": 9,
   "text": "One was coming toward me, about ten meters away."
  },
  {
   "i": 108,
   "start": 354.698,
   "end": 356.142,
   "startFrame": 10641,
   "endFrame": 10684,
   "words": 5,
   "text": "I pulled my feet in."
  },
  {
   "i": 109,
   "start": 356.692,
   "end": 358.352,
   "startFrame": 10701,
   "endFrame": 10751,
   "words": 5,
   "text": "My shoe brushed the bag."
  },
  {
   "i": 110,
   "start": 358.702,
   "end": 359.967,
   "startFrame": 10761,
   "endFrame": 10799,
   "words": 3,
   "text": "I stopped moving."
  },
  {
   "i": 111,
   "start": 360.517,
   "end": 361.783,
   "startFrame": 10816,
   "endFrame": 10853,
   "words": 3,
   "text": "It kept coming."
  },
  {
   "i": 112,
   "start": 362.333,
   "end": 366.799,
   "startFrame": 10870,
   "endFrame": 11004,
   "words": 15,
   "text": "I pressed farther into the doorway, trying not to touch the metal shutter behind me."
  },
  {
   "i": 113,
   "start": 367.349,
   "end": 371.165,
   "startFrame": 11020,
   "endFrame": 11135,
   "words": 14,
   "text": "When it was only a few meters away, my shoulder made the shutter click."
  },
  {
   "i": 114,
   "start": 371.715,
   "end": 372.687,
   "startFrame": 11151,
   "endFrame": 11181,
   "words": 2,
   "text": "It stopped."
  },
  {
   "i": 115,
   "start": 373.237,
   "end": 374.49,
   "startFrame": 11197,
   "endFrame": 11235,
   "words": 3,
   "text": "I stayed still."
  },
  {
   "i": 116,
   "start": 375.04,
   "end": 378.448,
   "startFrame": 11251,
   "endFrame": 11353,
   "words": 11,
   "text": "Then something metal clattered onto the road farther down the street."
  },
  {
   "i": 117,
   "start": 378.998,
   "end": 381.117,
   "startFrame": 11370,
   "endFrame": 11434,
   "words": 8,
   "text": "It turned toward the noise and moved on."
  },
  {
   "i": 118,
   "start": 381.66700000000003,
   "end": 384.871,
   "startFrame": 11450,
   "endFrame": 11546,
   "words": 10,
   "text": "I waited until I couldn't hear its footsteps before moving."
  },
  {
   "i": 119,
   "start": 385.421,
   "end": 388.37,
   "startFrame": 11563,
   "endFrame": 11651,
   "words": 11,
   "text": "I didn't know what would have happened without that other sound."
  },
  {
   "i": 120,
   "start": 388.92,
   "end": 391.027,
   "startFrame": 11668,
   "endFrame": 11731,
   "words": 8,
   "text": "But this wasn't a safe place to sleep."
  },
  {
   "i": 121,
   "start": 391.577,
   "end": 394.564,
   "startFrame": 11747,
   "endFrame": 11837,
   "words": 10,
   "text": "I stood up, put on the bag, and kept going."
  },
  {
   "i": 122,
   "start": 395.114,
   "end": 397.323,
   "startFrame": 11853,
   "endFrame": 11920,
   "words": 7,
   "text": "At ten fifty, I saw the river."
  },
  {
   "i": 123,
   "start": 397.873,
   "end": 402.174,
   "startFrame": 11936,
   "endFrame": 12065,
   "words": 13,
   "text": "Near the bridge, temporary fencing and a concrete wall marked an approach lane."
  },
  {
   "i": 124,
   "start": 402.724,
   "end": 406.706,
   "startFrame": 12082,
   "endFrame": 12201,
   "words": 11,
   "text": "Inside were traffic cones, an evacuation sign, and a white tent."
  },
  {
   "i": 125,
   "start": 407.256,
   "end": 408.815,
   "startFrame": 12218,
   "endFrame": 12264,
   "words": 4,
   "text": "I watched from outside."
  },
  {
   "i": 126,
   "start": 409.365,
   "end": 410.56600000000003,
   "startFrame": 12281,
   "endFrame": 12317,
   "words": 2,
   "text": "No staff."
  },
  {
   "i": 127,
   "start": 410.916,
   "end": 412.028,
   "startFrame": 12327,
   "endFrame": 12361,
   "words": 2,
   "text": "No buses."
  },
  {
   "i": 128,
   "start": 412.578,
   "end": 414.596,
   "startFrame": 12377,
   "endFrame": 12438,
   "words": 7,
   "text": "The tent blocked part of my view."
  },
  {
   "i": 129,
   "start": 414.946,
   "end": 418.456,
   "startFrame": 12448,
   "endFrame": 12554,
   "words": 13,
   "text": "I wanted to get closer and check for a notice or anyone inside."
  },
  {
   "i": 130,
   "start": 419.006,
   "end": 424.327,
   "startFrame": 12570,
   "endFrame": 12730,
   "words": 22,
   "text": "The lane was about a hundred and fifty meters long, with the wall on one side and the fence on the other."
  },
  {
   "i": 131,
   "start": 424.877,
   "end": 427.201,
   "startFrame": 12746,
   "endFrame": 12816,
   "words": 8,
   "text": "I looked for an opening along the fence."
  },
  {
   "i": 132,
   "start": 427.751,
   "end": 428.953,
   "startFrame": 12833,
   "endFrame": 12869,
   "words": 3,
   "text": "There wasn't one."
  },
  {
   "i": 133,
   "start": 429.503,
   "end": 432.694,
   "startFrame": 12885,
   "endFrame": 12981,
   "words": 12,
   "text": "If anything happened, I would have to come back the same way."
  },
  {
   "i": 134,
   "start": 433.244,
   "end": 434.33,
   "startFrame": 12997,
   "endFrame": 13030,
   "words": 3,
   "text": "I knew that."
  },
  {
   "i": 135,
   "start": 434.68,
   "end": 438.139,
   "startFrame": 13040,
   "endFrame": 13144,
   "words": 12,
   "text": "But after walking all morning, I didn't want to leave without checking."
  },
  {
   "i": 136,
   "start": 438.689,
   "end": 439.763,
   "startFrame": 13161,
   "endFrame": 13193,
   "words": 3,
   "text": "I went in."
  },
  {
   "i": 137,
   "start": 440.313,
   "end": 445.239,
   "startFrame": 13209,
   "endFrame": 13357,
   "words": 15,
   "text": "Under the tent were a folding table, paperwork, and paper cups scattered on the ground."
  },
  {
   "i": 138,
   "start": 445.789,
   "end": 447.182,
   "startFrame": 13374,
   "endFrame": 13415,
   "words": 3,
   "text": "Nobody was there."
  },
  {
   "i": 139,
   "start": 447.73199999999997,
   "end": 450.336,
   "startFrame": 13432,
   "endFrame": 13510,
   "words": 9,
   "text": "From that point, I could see the bridge clearly."
  },
  {
   "i": 140,
   "start": 450.886,
   "end": 452.713,
   "startFrame": 13527,
   "endFrame": 13581,
   "words": 4,
   "text": "Cars blocked both lanes."
  },
  {
   "i": 141,
   "start": 453.063,
   "end": 456.279,
   "startFrame": 13592,
   "endFrame": 13688,
   "words": 10,
   "text": "A large number of infected stood or wandered between them."
  },
  {
   "i": 142,
   "start": 456.829,
   "end": 458.80899999999997,
   "startFrame": 13705,
   "endFrame": 13764,
   "words": 6,
   "text": "There was no queue for transport."
  },
  {
   "i": 143,
   "start": 459.159,
   "end": 460.947,
   "startFrame": 13775,
   "endFrame": 13828,
   "words": 3,
   "text": "Nobody directing people."
  },
  {
   "i": 144,
   "start": 461.497,
   "end": 462.839,
   "startFrame": 13845,
   "endFrame": 13885,
   "words": 4,
   "text": "I checked my phone."
  },
  {
   "i": 145,
   "start": 463.389,
   "end": 464.794,
   "startFrame": 13902,
   "endFrame": 13944,
   "words": 2,
   "text": "Eleven forty-one."
  },
  {
   "i": 146,
   "start": 465.344,
   "end": 468.012,
   "startFrame": 13960,
   "endFrame": 14040,
   "words": 8,
   "text": "Nineteen minutes before the time in the message."
  },
  {
   "i": 147,
   "start": 468.562,
   "end": 469.968,
   "startFrame": 14057,
   "endFrame": 14099,
   "words": 4,
   "text": "I thought about leaving."
  },
  {
   "i": 148,
   "start": 470.51800000000003,
   "end": 473.505,
   "startFrame": 14116,
   "endFrame": 14205,
   "words": 10,
   "text": "Then I wondered if the buses simply hadn't arrived yet."
  },
  {
   "i": 149,
   "start": 473.855,
   "end": 476.459,
   "startFrame": 14216,
   "endFrame": 14294,
   "words": 11,
   "text": "What if I left and they came a few minutes later?"
  },
  {
   "i": 150,
   "start": 477.009,
   "end": 480.57,
   "startFrame": 14310,
   "endFrame": 14417,
   "words": 11,
   "text": "I waited beside the tent, keeping my distance from the bridge."
  },
  {
   "i": 151,
   "start": 481.12,
   "end": 484.49,
   "startFrame": 14434,
   "endFrame": 14535,
   "words": 10,
   "text": "At noon, the loudspeaker above me suddenly played a chime."
  },
  {
   "i": 152,
   "start": 485.04,
   "end": 487.3,
   "startFrame": 14551,
   "endFrame": 14619,
   "words": 8,
   "text": "I flinched and stepped away from the pole."
  },
  {
   "i": 153,
   "start": 487.85,
   "end": 489.524,
   "startFrame": 14636,
   "endFrame": 14686,
   "words": 4,
   "text": "A recorded voice followed."
  },
  {
   "i": 154,
   "start": 490.074,
   "end": 492.359,
   "startFrame": 14702,
   "endFrame": 14771,
   "words": 4,
   "text": "\"Evacuation transport is arriving."
  },
  {
   "i": 155,
   "start": 492.709,
   "end": 495.071,
   "startFrame": 14781,
   "endFrame": 14852,
   "words": 7,
   "text": "Please proceed to the marked waiting area.\""
  },
  {
   "i": 156,
   "start": 495.621,
   "end": 497.16700000000003,
   "startFrame": 14869,
   "endFrame": 14915,
   "words": 5,
   "text": "I looked toward the bridge."
  },
  {
   "i": 157,
   "start": 497.717,
   "end": 499.378,
   "startFrame": 14932,
   "endFrame": 14981,
   "words": 4,
   "text": "No vehicles were moving."
  },
  {
   "i": 158,
   "start": 499.928,
   "end": 502.825,
   "startFrame": 14998,
   "endFrame": 15085,
   "words": 9,
   "text": "But the nearest infected had turned toward the speaker."
  },
  {
   "i": 159,
   "start": 503.375,
   "end": 505.189,
   "startFrame": 15101,
   "endFrame": 15156,
   "words": 4,
   "text": "The announcement played again."
  },
  {
   "i": 160,
   "start": 505.739,
   "end": 507.757,
   "startFrame": 15172,
   "endFrame": 15233,
   "words": 6,
   "text": "They started coming toward the tent."
  },
  {
   "i": 161,
   "start": 508.10699999999997,
   "end": 509.767,
   "startFrame": 15243,
   "endFrame": 15293,
   "words": 4,
   "text": "More followed behind them."
  },
  {
   "i": 162,
   "start": 510.317,
   "end": 512.042,
   "startFrame": 15310,
   "endFrame": 15361,
   "words": 5,
   "text": "I didn't wait any longer."
  },
  {
   "i": 163,
   "start": 512.592,
   "end": 514.928,
   "startFrame": 15378,
   "endFrame": 15448,
   "words": 8,
   "text": "I turned and ran back toward the entrance."
  },
  {
   "i": 164,
   "start": 515.478,
   "end": 518.618,
   "startFrame": 15464,
   "endFrame": 15559,
   "words": 14,
   "text": "There was still a wall on one side and a fence on the other."
  },
  {
   "i": 165,
   "start": 518.968,
   "end": 520.438,
   "startFrame": 15569,
   "endFrame": 15613,
   "words": 4,
   "text": "Nowhere to turn off."
  },
  {
   "i": 166,
   "start": 520.988,
   "end": 523.35,
   "startFrame": 15630,
   "endFrame": 15700,
   "words": 10,
   "text": "I had to run the full length of the lane."
  },
  {
   "i": 167,
   "start": 523.9,
   "end": 526.007,
   "startFrame": 15717,
   "endFrame": 15780,
   "words": 7,
   "text": "Once I was out, I looked back."
  },
  {
   "i": 168,
   "start": 526.557,
   "end": 528.932,
   "startFrame": 15797,
   "endFrame": 15868,
   "words": 7,
   "text": "The first had almost reached the table."
  },
  {
   "i": 169,
   "start": 529.282,
   "end": 531.631,
   "startFrame": 15878,
   "endFrame": 15949,
   "words": 8,
   "text": "More were coming off the bridge behind them."
  },
  {
   "i": 170,
   "start": 532.181,
   "end": 535.181,
   "startFrame": 15965,
   "endFrame": 16055,
   "words": 12,
   "text": "If I'd kept waiting, they would have cut off my way out."
  },
  {
   "i": 171,
   "start": 535.731,
   "end": 538.858,
   "startFrame": 16072,
   "endFrame": 16166,
   "words": 10,
   "text": "I left the area and turned two corners before stopping."
  },
  {
   "i": 172,
   "start": 539.408,
   "end": 542.765,
   "startFrame": 16182,
   "endFrame": 16283,
   "words": 12,
   "text": "I crouched behind a dumpster and waited for my breathing to slow."
  },
  {
   "i": 173,
   "start": 543.315,
   "end": 545.142,
   "startFrame": 16299,
   "endFrame": 16354,
   "words": 6,
   "text": "I could still hear the speaker."
  },
  {
   "i": 174,
   "start": 545.692,
   "end": 548.016,
   "startFrame": 16371,
   "endFrame": 16440,
   "words": 6,
   "text": "It kept repeating the same announcement."
  },
  {
   "i": 175,
   "start": 548.566,
   "end": 550.405,
   "startFrame": 16457,
   "endFrame": 16512,
   "words": 7,
   "text": "I took out my phone and wrote:"
  },
  {
   "i": 176,
   "start": 550.955,
   "end": 554.159,
   "startFrame": 16529,
   "endFrame": 16625,
   "words": 10,
   "text": "Rule two: Find another way out before going farther in."
  },
  {
   "i": 177,
   "start": 554.709,
   "end": 557.415,
   "startFrame": 16641,
   "endFrame": 16722,
   "words": 9,
   "text": "I'd known to check for an exit since yesterday."
  },
  {
   "i": 178,
   "start": 557.965,
   "end": 560.646,
   "startFrame": 16739,
   "endFrame": 16819,
   "words": 11,
   "text": "I'd even checked the back door in the store that morning."
  },
  {
   "i": 179,
   "start": 561.196,
   "end": 564.26,
   "startFrame": 16836,
   "endFrame": 16928,
   "words": 9,
   "text": "But at the evacuation point, I'd ignored the problem."
  },
  {
   "i": 180,
   "start": 564.81,
   "end": 568.205,
   "startFrame": 16944,
   "endFrame": 17046,
   "words": 15,
   "text": "I'd seen the sign and the tent and hoped there were people who could help."
  },
  {
   "i": 181,
   "start": 568.555,
   "end": 571.797,
   "startFrame": 17057,
   "endFrame": 17154,
   "words": 13,
   "text": "I'd kept going even though I knew there was only one way back."
  },
  {
   "i": 182,
   "start": 572.347,
   "end": 577.146,
   "startFrame": 17170,
   "endFrame": 17314,
   "words": 17,
   "text": "I didn't know whether the message was old or the evacuation point had only just been abandoned."
  },
  {
   "i": 183,
   "start": 577.696,
   "end": 579.433,
   "startFrame": 17331,
   "endFrame": 17383,
   "words": 5,
   "text": "Knowing wouldn't help me now."
  },
  {
   "i": 184,
   "start": 579.983,
   "end": 583.123,
   "startFrame": 17399,
   "endFrame": 17494,
   "words": 11,
   "text": "I needed to leave before the speaker attracted more of them."
  },
  {
   "i": 185,
   "start": 583.673,
   "end": 586.188,
   "startFrame": 17510,
   "endFrame": 17586,
   "words": 6,
   "text": "I considered looking for somewhere nearby."
  },
  {
   "i": 186,
   "start": 586.738,
   "end": 588.539,
   "startFrame": 17602,
   "endFrame": 17656,
   "words": 6,
   "text": "But I didn't know the area."
  },
  {
   "i": 187,
   "start": 588.889,
   "end": 590.983,
   "startFrame": 17667,
   "endFrame": 17729,
   "words": 7,
   "text": "I had no food and little water."
  },
  {
   "i": 188,
   "start": 591.533,
   "end": 593.985,
   "startFrame": 17746,
   "endFrame": 17820,
   "words": 11,
   "text": "At least the old room had a door I could lock."
  },
  {
   "i": 189,
   "start": 594.335,
   "end": 596.582,
   "startFrame": 17830,
   "endFrame": 17897,
   "words": 7,
   "text": "I decided to get back before dark."
  },
  {
   "i": 190,
   "start": 597.132,
   "end": 598.78,
   "startFrame": 17914,
   "endFrame": 17963,
   "words": 4,
   "text": "The return was slower."
  },
  {
   "i": 191,
   "start": 599.33,
   "end": 601.182,
   "startFrame": 17980,
   "endFrame": 18035,
   "words": 5,
   "text": "I'd been walking since morning."
  },
  {
   "i": 192,
   "start": 601.532,
   "end": 604.276,
   "startFrame": 18046,
   "endFrame": 18128,
   "words": 10,
   "text": "My feet hurt, and I'd eaten only a few mints."
  },
  {
   "i": 193,
   "start": 604.826,
   "end": 609.013,
   "startFrame": 18145,
   "endFrame": 18270,
   "words": 17,
   "text": "Where I wasn't sure of the route, I stopped to check street signs and look for landmarks."
  },
  {
   "i": 194,
   "start": 609.563,
   "end": 613.022,
   "startFrame": 18287,
   "endFrame": 18391,
   "words": 12,
   "text": "Near a bus stop, I stepped off the curb without looking down."
  },
  {
   "i": 195,
   "start": 613.572,
   "end": 616.686,
   "startFrame": 18407,
   "endFrame": 18501,
   "words": 10,
   "text": "A loose piece of broken concrete shifted under my shoe."
  },
  {
   "i": 196,
   "start": 617.0360000000001,
   "end": 618.314,
   "startFrame": 18511,
   "endFrame": 18549,
   "words": 3,
   "text": "My ankle rolled."
  },
  {
   "i": 197,
   "start": 618.864,
   "end": 621.443,
   "startFrame": 18566,
   "endFrame": 18643,
   "words": 9,
   "text": "I grabbed the bus shelter to keep from falling."
  },
  {
   "i": 198,
   "start": 621.993,
   "end": 624.687,
   "startFrame": 18660,
   "endFrame": 18741,
   "words": 12,
   "text": "It hurt enough that I had to stand still for a while."
